% What lesson 8's cyclic graph should say.  With e linked back to a,
% every node reaches every node, so there is nothing to forbid, and
% mutation.py reports the edits that this graph cannot tell apart.
%
%   python3 diagnose.py programs/cyclic-routes.dl --expect programs/cyclic-routes.expect
%   python3 mutation.py programs/cyclic-routes.dl --expect programs/cyclic-routes.expect

path(a, e).              % the long way round
path(a, a).              % the loop
path(d, b).              % only through e and a
